.DS_Store
.idea/
.codegraph/
.codex-runtime/
.superpowers/
# OpenDesign 会在原型目录生成可再获取的本地技能快照，不作为项目事实提交。
**/.od-skills/
# 高保真原型由 OpenDesign 管理；截图只保存到 /private/tmp，强制入库由 project-verify 拒绝。
project/evidence/**/*.[pP][nN][gG]
project/evidence/**/*.[jJ][pP][gG]
project/evidence/**/*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
project/evidence/**/*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
docs/prototypes/**/*.[pP][nN][gG]
docs/prototypes/**/*.[jJ][pP][gG]
docs/prototypes/**/*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
docs/prototypes/**/*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]

# Local environments
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
deploy/.local/
# 本地验收账号由用户维护，禁止将真实凭据加入 Git。
/pwd.txt

# Build outputs
target/
dist/
build/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Runtime logs
*.log
*.pid
artifacts/_control/quality-run-report.json
artifacts/acceptance/
artifacts/evaluation/**/raw-evidence.tar.gz
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 文档区不保存截图，原型固定资源只允许受控文本与矢量资产。
docs/**/*.[pP][nN][gG]
docs/**/*.[jJ][pP][gG]
docs/**/*.[jJ][pP][eE][gG]
docs/**/*.[wW][eE][bB][pP]
